entries[198565] = { ["name"] = "Drakebreaker's Vestment", ["text"] = "Binds when picked up\nChest Cloth\n219 Armor\n+257 Intellect\n+416 Stamina\n+ 208 Critical Strike\n+ 270 Versatility\nDurability 165 / 165\nDrakebreaker's Garb (0/8)\nDrakebreaker's Shoulderpads\nDrakebreaker's Cuffs\nDrakebreaker's Cord\nDrakebreaker's Leggings\nDrakebreaker's Hood\nDrakebreaker's Gloves\nDrakebreaker's Boots\nDrakebreaker's Vestment\n(2) Set : Versatility increased by 56 .\n(4) Set : When you are stunned, harden your resolve, absorbing up to [ 23631 * (1 + Versatility)] damage for 10 sec. Cannot occur more than once every 2 min.\n(6) Set : Killing enemy players grants Breaker's Frenzy, increasing versatility by 2% and movement speed by 2%. Can stack up to 10 times.\nSell Price:" }
